o each other on the chromosome and amplify together. They were already present in the 2024 primary biopsy, with fewer copies.", "variante": {"gen": "MUTYH", "cambio": "G382D", "vaf": "43,2%", "es": "El informe recomienda un test en sangre para saber si es heredada o del tumor.", "en": "The report recommends a blood test to determine whether it is inherited or tumour-derived."}, "limpios": "AKT1 · BRCA1 · BRCA2 · ERBB2 · ESR1 · PIK3CA · PTEN", "limpios_nota_es": "Sin alteración reportable. Fiable para mutaciones puntuales; el panel no cubre fusiones de ESR1, pérdidas de una sola copia ni el HER2 por inmunohistoquímica.", "limpios_nota_en": "No reportable alteration. Reliable for point mutations; the panel does not cover ESR1 fusions, single-copy losses or HER2 by immunohistochemistry."}}